### Notes:
- This script uses `SortingLayer.layers` to get all available sorting layers.
- It updates all `Renderer` components in the selected GameObjects and their children.
- It uses `Undo.RecordObject` so changes can be undone.
- It marks the components as dirty to ensure changes are saved.
- Make sure your GameObjects have Renderer components that support `sortingLayerName`.

