// When starting the codec
codec.start();
isStarted = true;

// When stopping or releasing
codec.stop();
isStarted = false;
codec.release();
```

**Note:** Always ensure your state tracking aligns with the actual lifecycle of the `MediaCodec` to avoid inconsistencies.

**Summary:**

- No built-in method to check if `MediaCodec` has been started.
- Implement your own state management to track whether `start()` has been called.

